  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie om synergier mellan humanit&#xe4;ra st&#xf6;det och  utvecklingsst&#xf6;det</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on synergies between humanitarian and       development assistance - Study on synergies between humanitarian and</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Kiev &#xe4;mnar utf&#xf6;ra en studie som analyserar synergier mellan den humanit&#xe4;ra och utvecklingsportf&#xf6;ljen i Ukraina. Studien skall identifiera l&#xe4;rdomar samt rekommendationer om hur portf&#xf6;ljerna kan justeras f&#xf6;r att b&#xe4;ttre skapa synergier mellan det humanit&#xe4;ra och utvecklingsbist&#xe5;ndet. 

F&#xf6;r denna studie beh&#xf6;vs ett konsultteam med goda kunskaper om b&#xe5;de humanit&#xe4;rt bist&#xe5;nd och utv&#xe4;rdering. Ambassaden avser anv&#xe4;nda ramavtalet f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingar f&#xf6;r upphandling av konsulter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Kiev intends to carry out a study analysing synergies between the humanitarian and development portfolio in Ukraine. The study will identify lessons learned and recommendations on how portfolios can be adjusted to better create synergies between humanitarian and development aid.

For this study, a consulting team with good knowledge of both humanitarian aid and evaluation is needed. The Embassy intends to use the framework agreement for evaluations for the procurement of consultants.</narrative>
  </description>
